    "description": "The data consist of marine mammals (cetaceans and pinipeds) registries\nobtained during sightings during navigation to and from Cape Shirreff.  Data\nalso consist of observations of cetaceans in Cape Shirreff waters, during  the\nperiod of permanence in land, with the purpose of contributing to the knowledge\nof the distribution of the different species, as well as  their  relative\nabundance, in the zones in which they have been sighted.",
